Login with OTP - Manual Test Script

Objective :-

To verify that the user can log in successfully using a valid OTP and that the system rejects an invalid OTP.

Test Steps :-

1. Open the Paytm-style app.
2. Open the Login page.
3. Enter a valid registered mobile number.
4. Click on the **Send OTP** button.
5. Verify that an OTP is sent to the registered mobile number.
6. Enter the received **valid OTP** in the OTP field.
7. Click on the **Login/Verify** button.
8. Verify that the user is logged in successfully and redirected to the home page.
9. Log out from the application.
10. Open the Login page again and enter the same registered mobile number.
11. Click on the **Send OTP** button.
12. Enter an **invalid OTP** in the OTP field.
13. Click on the **Login/Verify** button.
14. Verify that the system does not allow the user to log in.
15. Verify that an appropriate error message such as "Invalid OTP" is displayed.
